Z||000004||Monkeyman||07-22-2000||11:43 AM||||Try Bestbuy's site.  Assuming they have it working now, they have the DSS internet service/equipment.  Something like $20/month?<P>$40/month for a cable pipe seems reasonable (high but in line with what other places charge).  We're supposed to get a cable pipe towards the end of the year.  I'll be the 1st to sign up.  This dial up modem sucks.  (Of course, part of the problem could be my 1 year old, but outdated computer.  Too much $$ to buy another one, though.)<P>------------------<BR>Dave-<BR>Grape Ape ('85GT)||||reg||1
